{
  "book": "alma",
  "bookName": "Alma",
  "chapter": 54,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 361.874,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 5.248,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now it came to pass in the commencement of the twenty and ninth year of the judges,",
      "verse": "54:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 5.428,
      "end": 10.304,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that Ammoron sent unto Moroni desiring that he would exchange prisoners.",
      "verse": "54:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 10.984,
      "end": 15.907,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that Moroni felt to rejoice exceedingly at this request,",
      "verse": "54:2",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 16.087,
      "end": 18.223,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for he desired the provisions",
      "verse": "54:2",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 18.403,
      "end": 23.001,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which were imparted for the support of the Lamanite prisoners",
      "verse": "54:2",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 23.181,
      "end": 25.457,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for the support of his own people;",
      "verse": "54:2",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 25.637,
      "end": 29.817,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he also desired his own people for the strengthening of his army.",
      "verse": "54:2",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 30.497,
      "end": 33.608,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now the Lamanites had taken many women and children,",
      "verse": "54:3",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 33.788,
      "end": 38.339,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and there was not a woman nor a child among all the prisoners of Moroni,",
      "verse": "54:3",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 38.519,
      "end": 41.213,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or the prisoners whom Moroni had taken;",
      "verse": "54:3",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 41.393,
      "end": 49.52,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore Moroni resolved upon a stratagem to obtain as many prisoners of the Nephites from the Lamanites as it were possible.",
      "verse": "54:3",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 50.2,
      "end": 52.336,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore he wrote an epistle,",
      "verse": "54:4",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 52.516,
      "end": 54.884,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and sent it by the servant of Ammoron,",
      "verse": "54:4",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 55.064,
      "end": 57.897,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the same who had brought an epistle to Moroni.",
      "verse": "54:4",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 58.077,
      "end": 61.839,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now these are the words which he wrote unto Ammoron, saying:",
      "verse": "54:4",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 62.519,
      "end": 65.584,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, Ammoron, I have written unto you somewhat",
      "verse": "54:5",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 65.764,
      "end": 72.544,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "concerning this war which ye have waged against my people, or rather which thy brother hath waged against them,",
      "verse": "54:5",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 72.724,
      "end": 76.207,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and which ye are still determined to carry on after his death.",
      "verse": "54:5",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 76.887,
      "end": 81.113,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, I would tell you somewhat concerning the justice of God,",
      "verse": "54:6",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 81.293,
      "end": 83.894,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the sword of his almighty wrath,",
      "verse": "54:6",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 84.074,
      "end": 85.746,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which doth hang over you",
      "verse": "54:6",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 85.926,
      "end": 91.406,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "except ye repent and withdraw your armies into your own lands, or the land of your possessions,",
      "verse": "54:6",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 91.586,
      "end": 93.536,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which is the land of Nephi.",
      "verse": "54:6",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 94.216,
      "end": 96.027,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, I would tell you these things",
      "verse": "54:7",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 96.207,
      "end": 99.272,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "if ye were capable of hearkening unto them;",
      "verse": "54:7",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 99.452,
      "end": 102.796,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, I would tell you concerning that awful hell",
      "verse": "54:7",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 102.976,
      "end": 108.502,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that awaits to receive such murderers as thou and thy brother have been,",
      "verse": "54:7",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 108.682,
      "end": 110.261,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "except ye repent",
      "verse": "54:7",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 110.441,
      "end": 112.949,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and withdraw your murderous purposes,",
      "verse": "54:7",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 113.129,
      "end": 116.101,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and return with your armies to your own lands.",
      "verse": "54:7",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 116.781,
      "end": 119.149,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But as ye have once rejected these things,",
      "verse": "54:8",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 119.329,
      "end": 121.79,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and have fought against the people of the Lord,",
      "verse": "54:8",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 121.97,
      "end": 124.571,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even so I may expect you will do it again.",
      "verse": "54:8",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 125.251,
      "end": 128.223,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now behold, we are prepared to receive you;",
      "verse": "54:9",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 128.403,
      "end": 138.666,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and except you withdraw your purposes, behold, ye will pull down the wrath of that God whom you have rejected upon you, even to your utter destruction.",
      "verse": "54:9",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 139.346,
      "end": 140.832,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But, as the Lord liveth,",
      "verse": "54:10",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 141.012,
      "end": 144.123,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "our armies shall come upon you except ye withdraw,",
      "verse": "54:10",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 144.303,
      "end": 146.857,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and ye shall soon be visited with death,",
      "verse": "54:10",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 147.037,
      "end": 150.148,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for we will retain our cities and our lands;",
      "verse": "54:10",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 150.328,
      "end": 153.765,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and we will maintain our religion and the cause of our God.",
      "verse": "54:10",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 154.445,
      "end": 156.953,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But behold, it supposeth me that I talk",
      "verse": "54:11",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 157.133,
      "end": 159.641,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to you concerning these things in vain;",
      "verse": "54:11",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 159.821,
      "end": 162.932,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or it supposeth me that thou art a child of hell;",
      "verse": "54:11",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 163.112,
      "end": 166.084,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore I will close my epistle by telling you",
      "verse": "54:11",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 166.264,
      "end": 168.679,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I will not exchange prisoners,",
      "verse": "54:11",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 168.859,
      "end": 170.438,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "save it be on conditions",
      "verse": "54:11",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 170.618,
      "end": 176.33,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that ye will deliver up a man and his wife and his children, for one prisoner;",
      "verse": "54:11",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 176.51,
      "end": 179.947,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "if this be the case that ye will do it, I will exchange.",
      "verse": "54:11",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 180.627,
      "end": 182.81,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold, if ye do not this,",
      "verse": "54:12",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 182.99,
      "end": 185.358,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I will come against you with my armies;",
      "verse": "54:12",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 185.538,
      "end": 188.557,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, even I will arm my women and my children,",
      "verse": "54:12",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 188.737,
      "end": 190.641,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I will come against you,",
      "verse": "54:12",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 190.821,
      "end": 193.422,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I will follow you even into your own land,",
      "verse": "54:12",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 193.602,
      "end": 196.621,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which is the land of our first inheritance;",
      "verse": "54:12",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 196.801,
      "end": 199.541,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and it shall be blood for blood,",
      "verse": "54:12",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 199.721,
      "end": 201.439,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, life for life;",
      "verse": "54:12",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 201.619,
      "end": 203.244,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I will give you battle",
      "verse": "54:12",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 203.424,
      "end": 206.814,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even until you are destroyed from off the face of the earth.",
      "verse": "54:12",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 207.494,
      "end": 210.559,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, I am in my anger, and also my people;",
      "verse": "54:13",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 210.739,
      "end": 212.689,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "ye have sought to murder us,",
      "verse": "54:13",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 212.869,
      "end": 215.237,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and we have only sought to defend ourselves.",
      "verse": "54:13",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 215.417,
      "end": 220.107,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But behold, if ye seek to destroy us more we will seek to destroy you;",
      "verse": "54:13",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 220.287,
      "end": 222.33,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and we will seek our land,",
      "verse": "54:13",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 222.51,
      "end": 224.646,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the land of our first inheritance.",
      "verse": "54:13",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 225.326,
      "end": 226.859,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now I close my epistle.",
      "verse": "54:14",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 227.039,
      "end": 228.293,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I am Moroni;",
      "verse": "54:14",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 228.473,
      "end": 231.027,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I am a leader of the people of the Nephites.",
      "verse": "54:14",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 231.707,
      "end": 233.843,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now it came to pass that Ammoron,",
      "verse": "54:15",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 234.023,
      "end": 236.159,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "when he had received this epistle,",
      "verse": "54:15",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 236.339,
      "end": 240.24,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "was angry; and he wrote another epistle unto Moroni,",
      "verse": "54:15",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 240.42,
      "end": 243.485,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and these are the words which he wrote, saying:",
      "verse": "54:15",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 244.165,
      "end": 246.998,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I am Ammoron, the king of the Lamanites;",
      "verse": "54:16",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 247.178,
      "end": 250.847,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I am the brother of Amalickiah whom ye have murdered.",
      "verse": "54:16",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 251.027,
      "end": 253.813,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, I will avenge his blood upon you,",
      "verse": "54:16",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 253.993,
      "end": 259.566,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and I will come upon you with my armies for I fear not your threatenings.",
      "verse": "54:16",
      "lineIndex": 76
    },
    {
      "start": 260.246,
      "end": 263.125,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For behold, your fathers did wrong their brethren,",
      "verse": "54:17",
      "lineIndex": 77
    },
    {
      "start": 263.305,
      "end": 267.81,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "insomuch that they did rob them of their right to the government",
      "verse": "54:17",
      "lineIndex": 78
    },
    {
      "start": 267.99,
      "end": 270.126,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "when it rightly belonged unto them.",
      "verse": "54:17",
      "lineIndex": 79
    },
    {
      "start": 270.806,
      "end": 273.453,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now behold, if ye will lay down your arms,",
      "verse": "54:18",
      "lineIndex": 80
    },
    {
      "start": 273.633,
      "end": 276.466,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and subject yourselves to be governed by those",
      "verse": "54:18",
      "lineIndex": 81
    },
    {
      "start": 276.646,
      "end": 279.34,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to whom the government doth rightly belong,",
      "verse": "54:18",
      "lineIndex": 82
    },
    {
      "start": 279.52,
      "end": 283.282,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "then will I cause that my people shall lay down their weapons",
      "verse": "54:18",
      "lineIndex": 83
    },
    {
      "start": 283.462,
      "end": 285.227,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and shall be at war no more.",
      "verse": "54:18",
      "lineIndex": 84
    },
    {
      "start": 285.907,
      "end": 290.412,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, ye have breathed out many threatenings against me and my people;",
      "verse": "54:19",
      "lineIndex": 85
    },
    {
      "start": 290.592,
      "end": 293.471,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but behold, we fear not your threatenings.",
      "verse": "54:19",
      "lineIndex": 86
    },
    {
      "start": 294.151,
      "end": 299.167,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Nevertheless, I will grant to exchange prisoners according to your request, gladly,",
      "verse": "54:20",
      "lineIndex": 87
    },
    {
      "start": 299.347,
      "end": 302.505,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I may preserve my food for my men of war;",
      "verse": "54:20",
      "lineIndex": 88
    },
    {
      "start": 302.685,
      "end": 305.425,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and we will wage a war which shall be eternal,",
      "verse": "54:20",
      "lineIndex": 89
    },
    {
      "start": 305.605,
      "end": 308.902,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "either to the subjecting the Nephites to our authority",
      "verse": "54:20",
      "lineIndex": 90
    },
    {
      "start": 309.082,
      "end": 311.358,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or to their eternal extinction.",
      "verse": "54:20",
      "lineIndex": 91
    },
    {
      "start": 312.038,
      "end": 315.335,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And as concerning that God whom ye say we have rejected,",
      "verse": "54:21",
      "lineIndex": 92
    },
    {
      "start": 315.515,
      "end": 318.673,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "behold, we know not such a being; neither do ye;",
      "verse": "54:21",
      "lineIndex": 93
    },
    {
      "start": 318.853,
      "end": 321.639,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but if it so be that there is such a being,",
      "verse": "54:21",
      "lineIndex": 94
    },
    {
      "start": 321.819,
      "end": 325.07,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "we know not but that he hath made us as well as you.",
      "verse": "54:21",
      "lineIndex": 95
    },
    {
      "start": 325.75,
      "end": 329.001,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And if it so be that there is a devil and a hell,",
      "verse": "54:22",
      "lineIndex": 96
    },
    {
      "start": 329.181,
      "end": 334.614,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "behold will he not send you there to dwell with my brother whom ye have murdered,",
      "verse": "54:22",
      "lineIndex": 97
    },
    {
      "start": 334.794,
      "end": 338.184,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "whom ye have hinted that he hath gone to such a place?",
      "verse": "54:22",
      "lineIndex": 98
    },
    {
      "start": 338.364,
      "end": 340.5,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But behold these things matter not.",
      "verse": "54:22",
      "lineIndex": 99
    },
    {
      "start": 341.18,
      "end": 347.728,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I am Ammoron, and a descendant of Zoram, whom your fathers pressed and brought out of Jerusalem.",
      "verse": "54:23",
      "lineIndex": 100
    },
    {
      "start": 348.408,
      "end": 350.962,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold now, I am a bold Lamanite;",
      "verse": "54:24",
      "lineIndex": 101
    },
    {
      "start": 351.142,
      "end": 354.439,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "behold, this war hath been waged to avenge their wrongs,",
      "verse": "54:24",
      "lineIndex": 102
    },
    {
      "start": 354.619,
      "end": 358.52,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and to maintain and to obtain their rights to the government;",
      "verse": "54:24",
      "lineIndex": 103
    },
    {
      "start": 358.7,
      "end": 361.208,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I close my epistle to Moroni.",
      "verse": "54:24",
      "lineIndex": 104
    }
  ]
}